+# Import merges into existing contacts and never removes data
+
+When an import row matches an existing contact by email, the row is merged into that contact rather than replacing it. The name from the file replaces the stored name. The phone is replaced only when the file gives a valid one, so an empty or invalid phone cell, or a missing phone column, never wipes a phone we already have. Tags from the file are added to the existing tags, and an import never removes a tag. This means export → edit → import does not round-trip removals: deleting a tag or phone in the spreadsheet has no effect on import.
